{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ls00px","slide":1,"text":"Portcullis is a security and compliance firewall for inbound institutional cross-chain settlement. The premise is simple: authenticate the message before any token transfer. The project has live testnet contracts, a public guardian dashboard, and a documented self-audit story.\n\nSource: project context supplied with the deck and docs/README.md."}
