{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/4j0894","slide":4,"text":"Arc is the settlement origination layer. ENS resolves the signing authority. Chainlink CRE supplies a private policy verdict. The guard enforces the decision. The Graph exposes inspection history and configuration. IIdentityRegistry and IPreSettlementPolicy keep identity and policy replaceable without turning the core checks into a governance surface.\n\nSource: README.md and docs/deployments.md."}
