{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/osh4iw","slide":6,"text":"All six confirmed findings were fixed the same day. The most important operational change is that malformed or unauthenticated traffic only rejects that message. The breaker latches only when an authenticated anomaly proves that a trusted authority or policy path is misbehaving. The remediated suite contained 128 Foundry tests across unit, fuzz, invariant, and exploit-replay coverage.\n\nSource: remediation narrative and test summary supplied with the original deck."}
